            f"Every one of the {total} documented operations of the Allegro REST API has its "
            "own step: offers and batch changes, products and categories, pricing and "
            "promotion, orders, returns, disputes and messages, shipping and delivery, account "
            "and fulfillment. Amounts are exact decimals. A connection is one Allegro or "
